# 'restante' is this locale's own word for the time that remains: it is the
# word timer_status.dialog already speaks, O temporizador {name} tem {remaining} restante.
# 'esquerda' below is the DIRECTION left and does not belong here. It is kept
# so no phrasing is lost until a speaker removes it. Both lines unvouched.
restante
esquerda
estatuto
feito
fim
fins
longo
pronto
